# Brief Explanation of the Project :

Netflix Movie Recommendation System using Collaborative Filtering
1. Business Problem

Streaming platforms like Netflix have thousands of movies and TV shows. Users often struggle to find relevant content, leading to:

Lower user engagement
Reduced watch time
Higher subscription churn
Poor customer experience

A recommendation system helps users discover movies they are likely to enjoy based on:

Past viewing/rating behavior
Similar users’ preferences
Similar movie patterns
2. Business Objective

The objective of this project is to build a Movie Recommendation System using Collaborative Filtering that can:

Recommend movies personalized to each user
Improve customer engagement
Increase watch time
Enhance user satisfaction
Reduce churn rate
3. Machine Learning Approach

We will use:

Collaborative Filtering

Collaborative filtering recommends movies based on:

User-user similarity
Item-item similarity
Matrix factorization concepts
Two Main Types
Type	Meaning
User-Based CF	Similar users like similar movies
Item-Based CF	Similar movies are liked together

This project uses:

Item-Based Collaborative Filtering
4. Dataset

We will use the popular:

MovieLens Dataset

Contains:

User IDs
Movie IDs
Ratings
Movie titles
Genres

Dataset source:
MovieLens Dataset


